  "type": "object"
}
Returns: A tuple containing (reference_image_file_path, target_object_id, reference_image_mask_results_path).
------------------------------
## Tool: segment_target_in_reference
Description: Isolate the specific target object in the reference image.
Parameters: {
  "properties": {
    "reference_image_file": {
      "description": "Path to the reference image file (output of 'argmax_image_and_seg_id').",
      "title": "Reference Image File",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "target_id": {
      "description": "The specific integer ID of the target object (output of 'argmax_image_and_seg_id').",
      "title": "Target Id",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "reference_image_mask_results_path": {
      "description": "Path to the saved mask results file (output of 'argmax_image_and_seg_id').",
      "title": "Reference Image Mask Results Path",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "parsed_query": {
      "description": "The structured JSON string (usually the output of 'query_parse').",
      "title": "Parsed Query",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "threshold": {
      "description": "Segmentation confidence threshold.",
      "title": "Threshold",
      "type": "number"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "reference_image_file",
    "target_id",
    "reference_image_mask_results_path",
    "parsed_query",
    "threshold"
  ],
  "type": "object"
}
Returns: The file path to the visualized reference image with the target object boxed/masked.
------------------------------
## Tool: vlm_frame_expansion
Description: Expand target search temporally using RAFT optical flow + VLM verification. Tracks the object frame-by-frame (forward and backward) using optical flow for efficiency and SAM/VLM for accuracy.
Parameters: {
  "properties": {
    "reference_image_file": {
      "description": "Path to the raw reference image file.",
      "title": "Reference Image File",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "reference_image_with_target_mask_box_file": {
      "description": "Path to the reference image with target masked/boxed.",
      "title": "Reference Image With Target Mask Box File",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "query": {
      "description": "The raw natural language query.",
      "title": "Query",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "parsed_query": {
      "description": "The structured JSON string.",
      "title": "Parsed Query",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "max_filtered_num": {
      "default": 16,
      "description": "Maximum number of frames to expand/track.",
      "title": "Max Filtered Num",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "threshold": {
      "default": 0.5,
      "description": "Segmentation confidence threshold.",
      "title": "Threshold",
      "type": "number"
    }
  },
  "required": [
