}
Returns: A tuple containing: 'path_to_updated_image_files_json, total_count_of_images'.
------------------------------
## Tool: segment_all_target_object
Description: Perform final segmentation on all candidate images for reconstruction.
Parameters: {
  "properties": {
    "image_files_path": {
      "description": "Path to the JSON list of verified candidate images.",
      "title": "Image Files Path",
